      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Customs (Amendment) Bill 2018"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 141m(1) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “subsection 68(2) of the Sales Tax Act 1972 and subsection 50(2) of the Service Tax Act 1975” the words “subsection 96(5) of the Sales Tax Act 2018, section 81 of the Service Tax Act 2018, and section 126 of the repealed Goods and Services Tax Act 2014 as provided under section 5 of the Goods and Services Tax (Repeal) Act 2018 [Act ]”. Substitution of section 141q"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 141q the following section: “Representation at hearing 141q. For the purpose of an appeal before the Tribunal— (a) the Director General may be represented by any officer authorized by him; and (b) the appellant may conduct the appeal himself or be represented by any person duly authorized by him.”. Amendment of section 141r"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_12__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_12__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 141r of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_12__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by renumbering the existing provision as subsection (1); and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_12__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) as renumbered the following subsections: “(2) Notwithstanding subsection (1), where the Tribunal is of the opinion that it would be in the interest of the public, the Tribunal may allow the publication of the facts of the appeal, decision of the appeal and reasons for the decision. (3) Notwithstanding subsection (2), the Tribunal shall not publish information the disclosure of which is prohibited or restricted by or under this Act or any other written law.”. New section 141ta"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 141t the following section: “Provisions relating to costs and expenses 141ta. The Tribunal may make an award as to costs and expenses as may be prescribed and may determine to what extent the costs and expenses are to be paid— (a) by the appellant, if the Tribunal is satisfied that the appellant had conducted his case in a frivolous or vexatious manner; or (b) by any party to the appeal, if the Tribunal is satisfied that in all circumstances of the case it would be unjust and inequitable not to award the costs and expenses.”. Saving"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any appeal before the Tribunal heard by a member of the Tribunal sitting alone or a panel of three members which is pending immediately before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall, on or after the date of coming into operation of this Act, continue to be heard and decided by the member of the Tribunal sitting alone or the panel of three members, as the case may be, as if the principal Act had not been amended by this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Customs (Amendment) Act 2018."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette. Amendment of section 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Customs Act 1967 [Act 235], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended in subsection 2(1)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of “computer” the following definition: ‘ “customs agent” means any person approved under section 90 to undertake any customs transactions on behalf of another person;’; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the definition of “manufacture”, by substituting for paragraph (c) the following paragraph: “(c) in the case of petroleum, any process of separation, purification, refining, conversion and blending; and”. Amendment of section 90"
      }
    },
    {
