        "@value": "by inserting after paragraph (c) the following paragraph: “(d) shall not have been proved against him or convicted on a charge in respect of— (i) an offence involving fraud or dishonesty; (ii) an offence under any written law relating to corruption; (iii) an offence under any written law relating to taxation; or (iv) any offence punishable with imprisonment for more than two years.”;"
